OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey Employment Trust sees
OL,4,Ademand rise by 25%
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn employment trust, which helps people
OL,7,Fwith additional needs into work, says
OL,8,Fit has seen demand jump by 25% year on
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FNikki Ioannou-Droushiotis, chief
OL,12,Fexecutive of Guernsey Employment Trust,
OL,13,Fsaid it had already seen the same
OL,14,Fnumber of referrals it had in 2025 by
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,F"We are on a trajectory to receive 300
OL,18,F[referrals] by the end of this year,"
OL,19,Fshe said adding it was hard to pinpoint
OL,20,Fwhat was behind the sharp rise in
OL,21,Fdemand.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
